1. Live Projects-> Make sure to launch and share it

2. System Design Documents-> Write this as you build the projects. This paired with no.1 is very very attractive to engineers and recruiters
Go in detail here. This could be really useful even for you

3. Architectural/System Design Diagrams-> Can be paired with no.2 as well
Use any diagramming model such as the C4 model, UML, or even simple blocks

4. UX/UI-> Pay attention to user experience. If your users can't find what to click on, your app sucks
Use tools like Gliffy, Balsamiq

5. Papers-> applicable to grad students
Sharing papers you wrote in your resume is extremely attractive

6. Blog Articles-> cool way to get discovered

7. Videos-> about what you are building
